Error [E0748]: `#(via missing)` on `run` names no such parameter
  --> tests/ui/effect_via_unknown_param.jet:4:42
    |
  4 | fn run(n: Int, act: #(Io) fn(Int)) #(via missing) {
    |                                          ^^^^^^^
 Why: `#(via f)` publishes the effects of a callback parameter `f`; `run` has no parameter called `missing`
 Fix: name one of `run`'s callback parameters after `via`
